---
title: SalesOrderQuote State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PendingRetailerAcceptance : quote issued when allocation commits the reservation (expiry deadline set)
    PendingRetailerAcceptance --> Accepted : Retailer accepts and chooses Prepaid or Credit
    PendingRetailerAcceptance --> Rejected : Retailer rejects (reason required, reservation released)
    PendingRetailerAcceptance --> Expired : deadline passed (reservation released)
    Accepted --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
    Expired --> [*]
